 3x"}, "body": "Hello there! I saw you did a microphone asset from someone and wanted to request one for myself!! My VTuber is Tauralite! She's a tarot loving, sweet and shy cottagecore type of longhorn. She loves all this astrology and witchy with a touch of softness. I'd like to use the microphone for streaming and clip purposes, but do not plan on making money off of this asset. I'd also like to request not only a small version of the mic but a longer one as well, because i plan on doing singing streams for it! >w< if the price needs to be adjusted for this please do so ♥ thank you for considering my request! \n\nThe colors you can use are similar to any of the colors in the reference photos, and  the design is completely up to you! I'm sure it'll look perfect ♥ if you can add a longhorn charm or something similar to the little charm on my reference to make it pop i'd appreciate it, if not that's totally fine! \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1zV41rO_WDHI6zGUTEfPbjAWKDpEkMf28?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@M_C_Perry_2/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1846167, "client_id": 3311280, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/63abe7d0/uploads/outputs/672e31b7-28a4-42c7-8258-bf44771c780f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5042511d96d0f9f255601c7ad5357960", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/63abe7d0/uploads/outputs/672e31b7-28a4-42c7-8258-bf44771c780f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5042511d96d0f9f255601c7ad5357960, https://si.imgix.net/63abe7d0/uploads/outputs/672e31b7-28a4-42c7-8258-bf44771c780f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dbaf441e7294383231baf031fdafdd4e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/63abe7d0/uploads/outputs/672e31b7-28a4-42c7-8258-bf44771c780f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=